    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-48FEAC7D2CF10FAC-Q4">
      <question_stem>우리말을 스페인어로 바르게 옮긴 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>우리말</keyword>
        <keyword>스페인어</keyword>
        <keyword>옮긴</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>¿A qué restaurante quieres que te lleve el día de tu cumpleaños?</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 스페인어 · llevar a + 장소와 querer que + 접속법
정답은 ③이다. llevar a + 장소이므로 의문사 앞에 전치사 a가 필요하고(¿A qué restaurante?), querer que 뒤에는 접속법(lleve)이 와야 한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>¿Qué restaurante quieras que te lleve el día de tu cumpleaños?</choice_text>
          <commentary>전치사가 빠지고 quieras가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>¿Qué restaurante quieres que te lleva el día de tu cumpleaños?</choice_text>
          <commentary>전치사가 빠지고 직설법을 썼다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>¿A qué restaurante quieres que te lleve el día de tu cumpleaños?</choice_text>
          <commentary>A qué restaurante, lleve이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>¿A qué restaurante quieres que te llevo el día de tu cumpleaños?</choice_text>
          <commentary>직설법 llevo를 썼다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2016년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
